issing_health_regen%%% of your missing health.", "notes_en": ["Multiple instances of Behemoth's Blood do not stack."], "attributes": ["+ 40 Strength", "+ 1% Max Health Regen"], "is_item": true}, {"subject": "heavens_halberd", "name_zh": "天堂之戟", "name_en": "Heaven's Halberd", "description_en": "Active: Disarm Prevents a target from attacking for %disarm_melee% seconds.", "notes_en": [], "attributes": ["+ 9 Armor", "+ 6.5 Health Regeneration", "+ 25% Evasion"], "is_item": true}, {"subject": "helm_of_iron_will", "name_zh": "铁意头盔", "name_en": "Helm of Iron Will", "description_en": "", "notes_en": [], "attributes": ["+ 4 Armor", "+ 4 Health Regeneration"], "is_item": true}, {"subject": "helm_of_the_dominator", "name_zh": "支配头盔", "name_en": "Helm of the Dominator", "description_en": "Active: Dominate Takes control of one neutral, non-ancient target unit and sets its movement speed to %speed_base% and max health to a minimum of %health_min%. Also provides the unit with +%creep_bonus_damage% base attack damage, +%creep_bonus_hp_regen% health regen, +%creep_bonus_mp_regen% mana regen and +%creep_bonus_armor% armor.   Dominated units with a max health of greater than %health_min% retain their original max health. Grants the caster %bounty_pct%%% of the gold and experience bounty of the dominated creep. Dominated unit's bounty is set to %bounty_gold% gold and it can no longer be killed by abilities that instantly kill creeps otherwise.  The Helm cannot be used for %creep_damage_taken_cooldown% seconds after the dominated creep takes damage from an enemy hero or Roshan.", "notes_en": ["Cannot dominate more than one unit at a time.  If a new unit is dominated, the old one will die.", "Can also Dominate enemy lane creeps and summoned units.", "Selling Helm of the Dominator will cause dominated units to die."], "attributes": ["+ 6 All Attributes", "+ 6 Armor", "+ 6 Health Regeneration"], "is_item": true}, {"subject": "helm_of_the_overlord", "name_zh": "统御头盔", "name_en": "Helm of the Overlord", "description_en": "Active: Dominate Takes control of one neutral target unit and sets its movement speed to %speed_base% and max health to a minimum of %health_min%. Also provides the unit with +%creep_bonus_damage% base attack damage, +%creep_bonus_hp_regen% health regen, +%creep_bonus_mp_regen% mana regen, +%creep_bonus_armor% armor, and levels up some abilities of the target by 1 level.   Dominated units with a max health of greater than %health_min% retain their original max health. Grants the caster the gold and experience bounty of the dominated creep. Dominated unit's bounty is set to %bounty_gold% gold and it can no longer be killed by abilities that instantly kill creeps otherwise.  The Helm cannot be used for %creep_damage_taken_cooldown% seconds after the dominated creep takes damage from an enemy hero or Roshan.", "notes_en": ["Can also Dominate enemy lane creeps and summoned units.", "Selling will cause dominated units to die."], "attributes": ["+ 21 All Attributes", "+ 7 Armor", "+ 7 Health Regeneration"], "is_item": true}, {"subject": "holy_locket", "name_zh": "圣洁吊坠", "name_en": "Holy Locket", "description_en": "Active: Energy Charge Target an allied unit to increase their incoming Heal Amplification by %incoming_heal_increase_active%%% for %active_buff_duration%s and instantly restore %health_restore_per_charge% health and %mana_restore_per_charge% mana per charge stored.   Automatically gains a charge every %AbilityChargeRestoreTime% seconds and whenever a visible enemy within %charge_radius% range uses an ability.   Passive: Holy Blessing Amplifies heals you provide by %heal_increase_passive%%%.", "notes_en": [], "attributes": ["+ 7 All Attributes", "COOLDOWN: 13"], "is_item": true}]
